---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  title="Car Wash & Detailing - Taqwa Automobile Service Center"
  description="Professional car wash and detailing in Uttara, Dhaka. Hand wash, interior deep cleaning, wax and polish, ceramic coating at Taqwa Automobile Service Center."
  path="car-wash-detailing.html"
  current="services"
>

<style define:vars={{ heroBg: `url(${base}img/hero-background.jpg)` }}>
  /* Everything shared with the rest of the site (tokens, reset, header,
     mobile nav, buttons/eyebrow, footer, why-choose, our-environment,
     our-features, our-latest-news, services-recap section, hybrid service
     process, the about-style CTA banner, and the shared .hybrid-content/
     .svc-reason-item/.hybrid-illustration selectors) now lives in
     src/styles/global.css. The "car wash", "our services", "our
     environment/features", "story", "stats" and "team" blocks that used to
     be duplicated here were dead CSS — this page never renders those
     sections — and have been dropped. Only the declarations genuinely
     specific to this page remain below. */

  /* Hero image needs the base-path-aware URL (global.css's .hero can't use
     Astro's define:vars); this page's hero paragraph is also a dimmer
     "muted" gray rather than global.css's near-white default. */
  .hero{
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(16,19,24,0.65), rgba(16,19,24,0.75)),
      var(--heroBg) center/cover no-repeat;
  }
  .hero-copy p{color:var(--muted);}

  /* This page's header collapses to the hamburger menu at 980px, not
     global.css's default 1024px — restore the full nav in that gap. */
  @media (min-width:981px) and (max-width:1024px){
    nav.main-nav > ul{display:flex;}
    .hamburger{display:none;}
    .call-btn{display:flex;}
  }

  /* This page's hybrid-section reuses the shared .hybrid-content/
     .svc-reason-item pattern with its own background-glow position and a
     wider hybrid-grid/hybrid-features-strip than the homepage's default. */
  .hybrid-panel::before{mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 75% 50%, black, transparent);}
  .hybrid-grid{gap:26px 22px;}
  .hybrid-features-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(6, 1fr);}

  /* This page's FAQ accordion uses a snappier, non-eased transition than the
     smoother default in global.css — preserved exactly as before. */
  .faq-question{transition:none;}
  .faq-question .faq-arrow::before, .faq-question .faq-arrow::after{
    transition:transform .25s ease, opacity .25s ease;
  }
  .faq-answer{transition:max-height .3s ease;}

  /* This page's inner-page banner uses a real photo background instead of
     global.css's default subtle grid-texture, plus its own fixed sizing. */
  .page-banner{
    background:linear-gradient(150deg, #18263A 0%, #0A0F17 100%);
    padding:68px 32px 58px;
  }
  .page-banner::before{
    background-image:url("img/background-2.jpg");
    background-size:cover; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat;
    mask-image:none;
  }
  .page-banner h1{font-size:44px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .page-banner{padding:44px 20px 40px;}
    .page-banner h1{font-size:30px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:420px){
    .page-banner{padding:36px 16px 32px;}
    .page-banner h1{font-size:25px;}
  }
</style>


<section class="page-banner">
  <div class="page-banner-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">SHOWROOM SHINE, EVERY VISIT</div>
    <h1 class="display">CAR WASH &amp; <span class="accent">DETAILING</span></h1>
    <p style="color:var(--off); font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; max-width:620px; margin:0 auto 20px;">A careful hand wash and deep interior clean that leaves your car looking, feeling and smelling like new.</p>
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">»</span>
      <span class="current">Car Wash &amp; Detailing</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-section" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="hybrid-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-panel">

      <div class="hybrid-header">
        <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">MORE THAN A WASH — <span class="accent">A COMPLETE REFRESH</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-content">
        <div class="story-content" style="position:relative;">
          <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:16px;">Dust, road grime and everyday wear build up fast in Dhaka traffic. At Taqwa Automobile, our wash and detailing team treats every car with care — no rushed rub-downs, no harsh chemicals that dull your paint.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">From a quick exterior wash to a full interior-and-exterior detailing package, we use the right products and techniques for your car's finish, so it comes out looking sharp and feeling fresh inside and out.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hybrid-illustration">
          <img src={base + "img/car-wash.jpg"} alt="Car wash and detailing service at Taqwa Automobile" style="width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:6px;">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-grid" style="margin-top:30px; padding-top:28px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); position:relative;">

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12c0-4 3-8 7-8s7 4 7 8" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M4 16h16M6 20h12" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Careful Hand Wash Process</h4>
            <p>Every car is washed by hand, with attention paid to trim, wheels and hard-to-reach spots that machines skip.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Premium Cleaning Products</h4>
            <p>Paint-safe shampoos and quality microfiber tools that clean thoroughly without scratching or fading your finish.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="6" width="16" height="12" rx="2" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 10h8M8 14h5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Interior Deep Cleaning</h4>
            <p>Vacuuming, upholstery cleaning and dashboard care that removes dust, odors and everyday grime from the cabin.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13.5H11l-1.3 8L18.5 9.5H12z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Paint Protection &amp; Shine</h4>
            <p>Wax and polish that restore gloss and add a protective layer against dust, sun and light scratches.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-features-strip">
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Hand Wash &amp; Dry</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Interior Vacuum &amp; Sanitize</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Premium Wax &amp; Polish</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Paint-Safe Products</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Same-Day Service</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Affordable Packages</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-process-section">
  <div class="hybrid-process-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-process-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR WASH &amp; <span class="accent">DETAILING PROCESS</span></h2>
      <p>From the first inspection to the final walk-around, every car gets the same careful attention at Taqwa Automobile.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-process-steps">

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">01</div>
        <h3>Pre-Wash Inspection</h3>
        <p>We check your car's condition and note any spots that need extra attention before we begin.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">02</div>
        <h3>Exterior Hand Wash</h3>
        <p>A thorough hand wash with paint-safe shampoo, followed by a careful hand dry to avoid water spots.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">03</div>
        <h3>Interior Vacuum &amp; Cleaning</h3>
        <p>Seats, carpets, dashboard and door panels are vacuumed and wiped down to remove dust and grime.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">04</div>
        <h3>Wax, Polish &amp; Shine</h3>
        <p>Quality wax and polish restore gloss and add a protective layer against dust and sun damage.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">05</div>
        <h3>Tire &amp; Trim Detailing</h3>
        <p>Tires, rims and exterior trim are cleaned and dressed for a finished, showroom look.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">06</div>
        <h3>Final Quality Check</h3>
        <p>We do a final walk-around with you to make sure every detail meets our standard before you drive off.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services-recap-section">
  <div class="services-recap-inner">
    <div class="services-recap-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR <span class="accent">WASH &amp; DETAILING SERVICES</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12c0-4 3-8 7-8s7 4 7 8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M4 16h16M6 20h12" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Exterior Hand Wash</h3>
          <p>A careful, paint-safe hand wash and dry that leaves your car's exterior spotless.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="6" width="16" height="12" rx="2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 10h8M8 14h5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Interior Vacuuming &amp; Cleaning</h3>
          <p>Seats, carpets and dashboard vacuumed and wiped down for a fresh, clean cabin.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Wax &amp; Polish</h3>
          <p>Quality wax and polish that restore shine and add a protective layer to your paint.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M2 12h4V6h4v12h4V6h4v12h4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Engine Bay Cleaning</h3>
          <p>Safe, careful cleaning of the engine bay to remove dust, grease and grime buildup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="9.5" y="9.5" width="5" height="5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Upholstery &amp; Seat Shampoo</h3>
          <p>Deep shampoo cleaning that lifts stains and odors from fabric and leather seats.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Headlight Restoration</h3>
          <p>Removing yellowing and cloudiness from headlights for better night visibility and looks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2L4.5 13.5H11l-1.3 8L18.5 9.5H12z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Ceramic Coating</h3>
          <p>Long-lasting protective coating for a deep shine and stronger resistance to dust and water.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 12l2 2 4-5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Full Detailing Package</h3>
          <p>Complete interior and exterior detailing that covers every part of your car in one visit.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="why-choose-section">
  <div class="why-choose-inner">

    <div class="why-choose-content">
      <div class="eyebrow-line">Why Trust Us</div>
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.3px;">With Your <span class="accent">Car Wash &amp; Detailing</span>?</h2>
      <p>A rushed wash can leave swirl marks and missed spots. Our team takes the time to do it properly, with paint-safe products and real attention to detail — inside and out.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-learn">
        Book Your Wash &amp; Detailing
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="why-choose-grid">

      <div class="wc-card tech">
        <img src={base + "img/car-servicing.jpg"} alt="Careful Trained Car Detailers" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Careful, Trained Detailers</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card tools">
        <img src={base + "img/car-wash.jpg"} alt="Premium Car Cleaning Products" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Premium Cleaning Products</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card parts">
        <img src={base + "img/Car-Wash-detailing.jpg"} alt="Attention to Every Car Detail" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Attention to Every Detail</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card service">
        <img src={base + "img/Trusted-Service.jpg"} alt="Affordable Car Wash Packages" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Affordable Packages</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">CAR WASH &amp; DETAILING <span class="accent">FAQ</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-column">

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            How long does a full detailing take?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">A basic wash usually takes under an hour, while a full interior-and-exterior detailing package can take a few hours depending on your car's condition.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Do you use products safe for my car's paint?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes, we use paint-safe shampoos and microfiber tools designed to clean without scratching or dulling your car's finish.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Can you remove stains from my seats?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">In most cases, yes. Our upholstery and seat shampoo service targets stains and odors on both fabric and leather seats — results depend on the stain type and age.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Do you offer packages for regular customers?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes, we offer affordable wash and detailing packages for customers who want to keep their car looking fresh on a regular schedule. Ask our team for current options.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Can I get my car washed while getting other service done?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Absolutely. Many customers combine a wash and detailing with engine repair, AC service, or other work during the same visit to save time.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-cta-section" id="contact">
  <div class="about-cta-inner">
    <h2>Give Your Car the Shine It Deserves</h2>
    <p>Book a wash, detailing package, or ask our team a question &mdash; call, message us on WhatsApp, or visit our workshop in Uttara.</p>
    <div class="about-cta-address">
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21s7-6.5 7-11.5a7 7 0 10-14 0C5 14.5 12 21 12 21z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.3" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
      <span>Sector # 15, Block # C, Road # 3/A, Plot # 40, Diabari, Uttara, Dhaka.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-cta-actions">
      <a href="tel:+8801854226757" class="btn btn-red">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        Call Now
      </a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/8801854226757" class="btn btn-green">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M17.6 6.32A8.86 8.86 0 0012 4a8.94 8.94 0 00-7.75 13.4L3 21l3.7-1.23A8.94 8.94 0 0012 21a8.94 8.94 0 006.32-15.32z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M9 8.5c.3-.6 1-1 1.6-.5.5.4.9 1.4.6 2-.3.6-1.1 1.1-.7 1.9.5.9 1.7 2.1 2.6 2.6.8.4 1.3-.4 1.9-.7.6-.3 1.6.1 2 .6.5.6.1 1.3-.5 1.6-1.2.6-2.7.4-4-.2-1.8-.8-3.4-2.4-4.2-4.2-.6-1.3-.8-2.8-.2-4z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
        WhatsApp Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


</Layout>
